+# Feature Specification: Create JSON Patch
+
+**Input**: "Export `createPatch(from, to)` from `src/index.ts`, returning a JSON Patch (RFC 6902) that turns `from` into `to`."
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: `applyPatch(from, createPatch(from, to))` MUST deep-equal `to`.
+- **FR-002**: The patch describes only what changed: equal values yield `[]`; objects are diffed per member and arrays per element, recursively. Whole-document replacement is used only when the root types or primitive values differ.
+- **FR-003**: Arrays: common prefix/suffix are skipped, overlapping middle elements are diffed in place, the remainder is added or removed.
+- **FR-004**: Pointer tokens escape `~` and `/`; `__proto__` members are plain data.
+- **FR-005**: Neither input is mutated; the patch shares no structure with them.
+
+## Implementation
+`src/diff.ts`; tests in `test/diff.test.ts`.
